#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/019_the_stable/mission.json
msgid "The Stable"
msgstr ""

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/019_the_stable/mission.json
msgid ""
"Ragnfrid's foal needs a stable before she comes. Bring six logs from Arne's forest in Frosttorp, a"
" crate of iron tools from the smith, and tar from Ekvik. Six logs are more than your boat holds!"
msgstr ""

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/019_the_stable/mission.json
msgid "Good straight pine. Load what fits, and come back for the rest."
msgstr ""

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/019_the_stable/mission.json
msgid "Nails and an axe: now we can build."
msgstr ""

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/019_the_stable/mission.json
msgid ""
"Hammer, saw, tar on the roof... The stable stands! And we bought the east meadow for the foal to "
"run in."
