#: data/missions/021_the_foal_comes_home/mission.json
msgid ""
"Silke's filly is big enough now, and the stable is ready. Take her home! She is nervous on the "
"water: make room in the boat, and row gently."
msgstr ""

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/021_the_foal_comes_home/mission.json
msgid "There, little one, stand still. Row gently, girls!"
msgstr ""

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/021_the_foal_comes_home/mission.json
msgid "She trots into the new stable and sniffs the hay. Your first horse! What will you call her?"
