"My fire needs charcoal, lots of it! Old Grim burns charcoal in the woods by Svanetorp. Bring me "
"seven sacks; it will take you more than one trip."
msgstr ""

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/023_charcoal_for_the_smith/mission.json
msgid "Black as night and light as a feather. Mind your dresses!"
msgstr ""

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/023_charcoal_for_the_smith/mission.json
msgid "Now my fire roars! Here, for your help: silver, and a little iron nail for luck."
