#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/025_letters_for_the_chieftain/mission.json
msgid "Letters for the Chieftain"
msgstr ""

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/025_letters_for_the_chieftain/mission.json
msgid ""
"Inga the messenger left a letter here for Chieftain Eirik, but she rowed off without it! Take it "
"to Hjortingsala. The answer goes to Orm at the inn of Hallvik."
msgstr ""

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/025_letters_for_the_chieftain/mission.json
msgid "Sealed with wax. Do not let it get wet!"
msgstr ""

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/025_letters_for_the_chieftain/mission.json
msgid "Orm wants to brew for the autumn feast. Tell him: yes, and much!"
msgstr ""

